---
---

<section
        class="py-16 bg-slate-900 relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800"
    >
        <div
            class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-500 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[120px] opacity-10 pointer-events-none"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div
                class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center md:items-end mb-12 reveal gap-6"
            >
                <div class="max-w-2xl text-center md:text-left">
                    <span
                        class="text-brand-400 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-2 block"
                        >Legalitas & Safety First</span
                    >
                    <h2
                        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-white"
                    >
                        Kepatuhan Operasional.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-4">
                        Kami menjamin seluruh kegiatan mematuhi regulasi aviasi
                        Indonesia guna memastikan insiden nol di lapangan.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-4">
                    <div
                        class="px-5 py-3 bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 text-center shadow-md"
                    >
                        <p
                            class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-brand-400"
                        >
                            100%
                        </p>
                        <p
                            class="text-[10px] text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mt-1"
                        >
                            Zero Accident
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <div
                    class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-brand-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all reveal delay-100 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-700 text-brand-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 group-hover:bg-brand-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    >
                        🪪
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1 text-white">
                            Pilot Tersertifikasi
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                            Operator kami memiliki sertifikasi resmi APDI sesuai
                            regulasi Kemenhub RI.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-brand-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all reveal delay-200 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-700 text-brand-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 group-hover:bg-brand-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    >
                        📜
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1 text-white">
                            Izin SIDOPI & AirNav
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                            Kami menangani clearance ruang udara resmi untuk
                            operasi di area Red Zone.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-brand-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all reveal delay-300 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-700 text-brand-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 group-hover:bg-brand-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    >
                        🔄
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1 text-white">
                            Backup Unit Standby
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                            Selalu ada drone cadangan di lapangan agar alur
                            kerja klien tidak terhambat.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex items-start gap-4 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-brand-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all reveal delay-400 group"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-700 text-brand-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 group-hover:bg-brand-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    >
                        🛠️
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1 text-white">
                            SOP Perawatan Rutin
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                            Unit selalu dirawat berkala untuk mencegah kegagalan
                            teknis saat di udara.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
